  "description": "Noah’s a small-time pickpocket. He’s a bit of a slacker who’s never really had a steady job but when he hears of an opportunity to steal a rare diamond, for the first time in his life, he gets ambitious. With his new crown jewel, he plans to start fresh and escape his mediocre life. But things don’t go according to plan when two guys, who have it out for each other, both get involved. Noah’s really mashed up between a rock and a hard place. How the hell is he going to get out of this one…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
